#: ../../functions/func_get_original.rst:6
msgid "$get_original"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_get_original.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$get_original(name)**"
msgstr "用法：**$get_original(name)**"

#: ../../functions/func_get_original.rst:9
msgid "Category: text"
msgstr "类别：文本"

#: ../../functions/func_get_original.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 3.0"
msgstr "实现：Picard 3.0"

#: ../../functions/func_get_original.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_get_original.rst:14
msgid "Returns the value from original metadata only for the variable ``name`` or an empty string if ``name`` has not been set. If ``name`` is another variable (e.g. ``%indirect%``) the value of the variable will be used as ``name``. This allows the retrieval of dynamically named variables."
msgstr ""
"仅从原始元数据返回变量``name``的值，如果``name``未设置则返回空字符串。如"
"果``name``是另一个变量（例如``%indirect%``），则变量的值将用作``name``。这允"
"许检索动态命名的变量。"

#: ../../functions/func_get_original.rst:18
msgid "Usually you can access the values of a tag by the proper variable name. For example, if your tag is called \"rerecorded\" you can use ``%rerecorded%``. But the hyphen is not a valid character for a script variable, so ``%re-recorded%`` gives a syntax error. In cases like this you need to use ``$get_original(re-recorded)``."
msgstr ""
"通常，您可以通过正确的变量名访问标签的值。例如，如果您的标签名"
"为\"rerecorded\"，您可以使用``%rerecorded%``。但由于连字符不是脚本变量的有效"
"字符，所以``%re-recorded%``会引发语法错误。在这种情况下，您需要使"
"用``$get_original(re-recorded)``。"

#: ../../functions/func_get_original.rst:20
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

